option.FIRMAMENT.comment=An edit of Steadfast made by Remiiil1a. It adds labPBR \
	material support (normal, specular, parallax, subsurface and emissive maps, \
	plus reflections) and support for the End.\n\n\
	The original shader is Steadfast, developed by coderbot, and can be \
	downloaded from https://modrinth.com/shader/steadfast-shaders (Modrinth), \
	https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/shaders/steadfast (CurseForge), or \
	https://github.com/coderbot16/Steadfast (GitHub). Anyone can modify and \
	distribute it under the terms of the GNU General Public License, version 3. \
	Steadfast's additional terms require the name of a modified version to end \
	with "(edit of coderbot's Steadfast)", which is why this one does.\n\n\
	Code from Mellow Shader v3.4 and Sundial Lite is referenced or quoted here \
	as well; each is credited on the Special thanks page below.\n\n\
	This is not an official Steadfast release and is not supported by coderbot. \
	See NOTICE.md and README.md for the full licence summary.
value.FIRMAMENT.BY_REMIIIL1A=edited by Remiiil1a

